From ff06fab7c575a35bd550c1ebda93b75da572d570 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Quarrier <squarrier@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:39:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] api: --served-model-name (repeatable) /
 GLM53F_SERVED_MODEL_NAMES

The first name is the response `model` and every name is listed by
/v1/models, so a deployment can keep a stable alias (e.g. an existing
OpenAI-compatible endpoint name). Unset keeps the upstream id
glm-5.3-flash. API layer only: no numerics change.
---
